{
  "_comment": "Sound (Session 7). Every sound is made in code (Web Audio synth, no files) unless data/assets.json has a 'sound.<id>' file for it — then the file is played instead (mp3/ogg/wav, royalty-free only). buses: how loud each group is at 100% in Settings (master multiplies all). hearDistance: metres after which a sound is silent. maxVoices: limit of short sounds playing at once (phones).",
